    "The certificate hostname can differ from the mail domain after @. Its A/AAAA records must point to this server; MX, SPF, DKIM, and DMARC do not validate an HTTP-01 certificate.":"证书主机名可与邮箱 @ 后的域名不同。该主机名的 A／AAAA 记录必须指向此服务器；MX、SPF、DKIM 和 DMARC 记录不用于 HTTP-01 证书验证。",
